  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_RivalAlreadyLeft",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} already left.\r",
        "I don’t know what it was about, but\n",
        "he sure was in a hurry!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} est déjà parti.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas ce qu’il voulait, mais\n",
        "il était très pressé!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_KnowHowImpatientRivalIs",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: You know how impatient\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is.\r",
        "He took off before I could even\n",
        "ask what it was about."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Tu sais à quel point\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} est impatient.\r",
        "Il est parti avant que je ne puisse lui\n",
        "poser la moindre question."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_YouTakeCareNow",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Bye-bye, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You take care now!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Au revoir, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Fais bien attention à toi!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_RivalAlwaysInvitesYouAlong",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: But that {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}...\n",
        "He always invites you along."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}... Il veut\n",
        "toujours que tu l’accompagnes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_DontGoIntoTallGrass",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Oh, yes!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Don’t go into the tall grass.\n",
        "Wild Pokémon might attack you.\r",
        "It would be OK if you had your own\n",
        "Pokémon, but you don’t, so...\r",
        "Well, take care, sweetie!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Ah, oui!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Ne va pas dans les hautes herbes.\n",
        "Des Pokémon sauvages pourraient\f",
        "t’attaquer.\r",
        "Ça irait si tu avais ton propre Pokémon,\n",
        "mais tu n’en as pas, alors...\r",
        "A bientôt, mon chou!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_IsntRivalWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: What is it, dear?\n",
        "Isn’t {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} waiting for you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Que se passe-t-il, mon chou?\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} t’attend, tu sais?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_WowThatHappenedToYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: What’s the matter, dear?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Wow.\n",
        "That’s what happened to you?\r",
        "You and {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} are lucky to have\n",
        "met Prof. Rowan.\r",
        "Imagine if you didn’t...\r",
        "I wouldn’t like to think what the wild\n",
        "Pokémon might have done to you two.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, go see Prof. Rowan, and\n",
        "thank him properly for your Pokémon.\r",
        "His lab is in Sandgem Town, isn’t it?\r",
        "Now that you have your own Pokémon,\n",
        "the tall grass won’t be so threatening.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Qu’est-ce qui se passe,\n",
        "mon chou?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Vraiment?\n",
        "Waouh!\r",
        "Toi et {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} avez de la chance\n",
        "d’être tombés sur le Professeur\f",
        "Sorbier.\r",
        "Imagine ce qui se serait passé sinon...\r",
        "Je préfère ne pas penser à ce que les\n",
        "Pokémon sauvages vous auraient fait.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}, va voir le Professeur\n",
        "Sorbier et remercie-le comme il\f",
        "se doit.\r",
        "Son labo est à Littorella, je crois.\r",
        "Maintenant que tu as ton propre\n",
        "Pokémon, les hautes herbes ne sont\f",
        "plus une menace.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_PutTheseOn",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I know!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, put these on.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, je sais!\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, enfile ça.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_PlayerReceivedRunningShoes",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a pair of\n",
        "{COLOR 1}Running Shoes{COLOR 0}!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient les {COLOR 1}Chaussures de\n",
        "Sport{COLOR 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_LetMeReadTheInstructions",
      "en_US": [
        "Going to Sandgem Town is like an\n",
        "adventure in itself, right?\r",
        "With those Running Shoes, you can\n",
        "get to faraway places much faster.\r",
        "OK...\n",
        "Let me read the instructions...\r",
        "“Press the B Button and dash\n",
        "about faster than ever before!\r",
        "“Put on the Running Shoes and\n",
        "blaze new trails of adventure!”\r",
        "Well, isn’t that just nifty!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Se rendre à Littorella est une\n",
        "aventure en soi, n’est-ce pas?\r",
        "Avec ces Chaussures de Sport, tu peux\n",
        "te déplacer beaucoup plus vite.\r",
        "OK...\n",
        "Je vais te lire le mode d’emploi...\r",
        "“Maintenez le bouton B appuyé pour\n",
        "filer comme le vent!\r",
        "Enfilez les Chaussures de Sport et\n",
        "partez à l’aventure!”\r",
        "Bon, ça m’a l’air très bien!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_IllReadTheInstructions",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: I’ll read you the instructions\n",
        "for the Running Shoes...\r",
        "“Press the B Button and dash\n",
        "about faster than ever before!\r",
        "“Put on the Running Shoes and\n",
        "blaze new trails of adventure!”\r",
        "Well, isn’t that just nifty!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Je vais te lire le mode d’emploi\n",
        "de ces Chaussures...\r",
        "“Maintenez le bouton B appuyé pour\n",
        "filer comme le vent!\r",
        "Enfilez les Chaussures de Sport et\n",
        "partez à l’aventure!”\r",
        "Bon, ça m’a l’air très bien!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_MorningTakeAQuickRest",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Welcome home, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Are you and your Pokémon healthy?\r",
        "It’s still early in the morning.\n",
        "Take a quick rest, dear.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Bienvenue, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\n",
        "Tu es en forme?\r",
        "Il est encore très tôt.\n",
        "Repose-toi un peu, mon chou.\r"
      ]
    },
