    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_YourMomsGotYourBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: What is it, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "...\r",
        "Wow. Professor Rowan asked you\n",
        "to do something that big.\r",
        "OK, dear, go for it!\n",
        "Your mom’s got your back!\r",
        "Oh, I know! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, I’ve got\n",
        "something that you’ll find useful.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Quoi de neuf, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\r",
        "...\r",
        "C’est une mission de premier ordre que\n",
        "t’a confiée le Professeur Sorbier.\r",
        "Fonce, mon chou! Ta maman est de\n",
        "tout cœur avec toi!\r",
        "Oh, je sais! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, j’ai quelque\n",
        "chose qui pourrait t’être utile.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_ThatsAJournal",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s a Journal. It keeps a record\n",
        "of your daily events.\r",
        "Check it, and you’ll be able to\n",
        "remember what you did last.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "C’est un Journal. Il enregistre les\n",
        "événements quotidiens.\r",
        "Consulte-le et tu pourras te souvenir\n",
        "de ce que tu as fait en dernier.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_IWishICouldGoInstead",
      "en_US": [
        "Gee, a journey full of adventure...\n",
        "I envy you, kiddo.\r",
        "Plus, you’re not alone.\n",
        "You have your Pokémon with you.\f",
        "I wish I could go instead!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Pfiou, un voyage plein d’aventures...\n",
        "Je t’envie, mon petit chou.\r",
        "En plus, tes Pokémon t’accompagnent.\n",
        "J’aimerais pouvoir prendre ta place!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_GoEnjoyYourAdventure",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m just joking, dear!\n",
        "Yup, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "I’ll be all right by myself, so you\n",
        "go and enjoy your adventure!\r",
        "When you’re exposed to new things,\n",
        "and experience new sensations...\f",
        "It makes your mother happy, too.\r",
        "...But come back sometimes.\r",
        "I would like to see the kinds of\n",
        "Pokémon you’ve caught, dear.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je plaisante, mon chou!\n",
        "Ouaip, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Je vais me débrouiller seule, pars et\n",
        "profite de ton aventure!\r",
        "Que tu découvres de nouvelles choses\n",
        "et de nouvelles sensations...\f",
        "me rend heureuse, moi aussi.\r",
        "... Mais reviens de temps en temps.\r",
        "J’aimerais voir les Pokémon que tu\n",
        "auras attrapés, mon chou.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_AskIsRivalHere",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s mom: Excuse me.\n",
        "Is my little {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} here?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mère de {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: Excusez-moi.\n",
