      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_NoHesNot",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: Oh?\n",
        "No, he’s not...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: Oh?\n",
        "Non, il n’est pas là...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_HeMustHaveLeftAlready",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s mom: Oh...\n",
        "Then, he must have left already...\f",
        "What to do...\r",
        "That boy shouted about going on an\n",
        "adventure, then he bolted.\r",
        "He’s so headstrong and reckless...\n",
        "I at least wanted him to take this...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Mère de {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: Oh...\n",
        "Alors, il a déjà dû partir...\f",
        "Que faire...?\r",
        "Mon garçon m’a crié qu’il partait à\n",
        "l’aventure, puis il s’est précipité.\r",
        "Il est si têtu et téméraire...\n",
        "Je voulais au moins lui donner ceci...\r"
      ]
    },
