    {
      "id": "TwinleafTownPlayerHouse1F_Text_RivalCameLookingForYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} came looking for you\n",
        "a little while ago.\r",
        "I don’t know what it was about, but\n",
        "he was shouting about you needing\f",
        "to get on a ship at Snowpoint City.\r",
        "You know how impatient he is.\n",
        "He was gone before I could ask."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Maman: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} est passé pour te voir\n",
        "il n’y a pas longtemps.\r",
        "Je ne sais pas de quoi il s’agit, mais il\n",
        "m’a crié que tu devais monter à bord\f",
        "d’un bateau à Frimapic.\r",
        "Tu sais à quel point il est impatient.\n",
        "Il est reparti avant que j’aie eu\f",
        "le temps de dire ouf."
      ]
